; Date typos at the ends of a budget's months. A definition dated in the year 0024 starts its budget's months two
; thousand years early; a budget-add dated 9999 runs its budget's months to 9999. Each is one budget's months, under
; the result size limit: the pages answer, and so does a query over every month.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Food
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Old
  budget: Old

0024-01-01 budget Old CNY
2024-01-01 budget Food CNY
2024-01-01 budget Normal CNY

2024-01-01 budget-add Food 100 CNY
9999-12-01 budget-add Food 1 CNY

2024-01-10 * "Market" "lunch"
  Expenses:Food 10 CNY
  Assets:Bank

2024-01-11 * "Shop" "something old"
  Expenses:Old 5 CNY
  Assets:Bank
